        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Greg Anthony, Jim Jackson, Stacey Augmon\n- Organizations: Portland Trail Blazers, Vancouver Grizzlies, Seattle SuperSonics, CBS Sports, UNLV, NBA\n- Roles: free agent, player, television analyst\n- Events: 1996–97 Vancouver Grizzlies season, 1998–99 Portland Trail Blazers season, offseason\n\nFacts:\n- Following the 1996–97 Vancouver Grizzlies season, Greg Anthony signed with the Seattle SuperSonics as a free agent.\n- Greg Anthony was born on November 15, 1967.\n- During the offseason before the 1998–99 Portland Trail Blazers season, the Portland Trail Blazers signed free agents Jim Jackson and Greg Anthony.\n- Greg Anthony reunited on the Portland Trail Blazers with his former UNLV teammate Stacey Augmon.\n- Greg Anthony is an American former NBA player.\n- Greg Anthony later became a television analyst for CBS Sports.",
